# Play test of The Drowned Metropolis (CIPlay drowned_metropolis, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe:
# the ferry islet west, the Harbour Tower south-west (roof 12-21 m), the sunken offices and the Spire's foundations in
# the middle, the Meridian Tower east (pool deck 6-9 m). The quest has 20 steps; the city's papers (notes and the chests'
# tags) go into the journal as they are read, and its pages steps follow (3, 4, 5, 6).
island The Drowned Metropolis
# (no offset: the city's points line up with the island as it comes - the recipe's land-centre offset, -14 7, put
# the Harbour Tower's ladder 17 m off; 10-27)
expect step 0
expect title The Keys of Meridian

# The ferry islet: the evacuation notice
walk -52 -41 to -44 -34 h=4
zone ferry
expect step 1
read Evacuation notice
expect step 2

# Up the Harbour Tower's ladders, up its roof to the mayor's penthouse
climb -19.2 -50 h=0.3
climb -19.2 -50 h=6.5
expect stand -22 -50 h=12.4
zone harbourroof
expect step 3
walk -22 -50 to -35 -50 to -45 -50 to -50.5 -50 to -55.5 -49.5 h=21.2
read Mayor's memo
expect step 4
open Penthouse safe
expect story keycard 1
wait 1
expect item OxygenBottle 1
expect step 7

# Down to the sunken council offices: puffer fish, the filing cabinet
zone offices
expect step 8
expect message puffs up
kill Puffer fish
expect step 9
open Council filing cabinet
expect story keycard 2
wait 1
expect step 12

# The Spire's foundations: the Lantern Lord, the treasurer's strongbox
zone foundations
expect step 13
expect message a light swings
kill Angler fish
expect step 14
open Foundation strongbox
expect story keycard 3
wait 1
expect step 17

# Up the Meridian Tower to the pool deck: the vault
climb 45.7 -2 h=-3
climb 45.7 -2 h=3
expect stand 48 -2 h=8.8
zone meridianroof
expect step 18
open Meridian Vault
wait 2
expect story keycard 0
expect item Blueprint_BatteryAdvanced 1
wait 1
expect done
# DEEP 10-25 (off the quest): Lena's camp on the north-east islet, the treasurer's house sunk east of the Meridian Tower
at 25 49
read Deckhand Lena Moss's letter
open Deckhand's crate
zone cranehouse
air craneair
read Treasurer Silas Crane's note
open Treasurer's chest

# ABYSS 10-26: the secrets of the 1-hour pass (no steps) - Calder's note at Lena's camp, the Meridian badges (a set),
# the harbour lamps (puzzle lights) and the harbour master's strongbox, the seaplane, the sea cave, the rooftop run
read Dr. Ruth Calder's field note
use Meridian badge 1
use Meridian badge 2
use Meridian badge 3
use Meridian badge 4
use Meridian badge 5
wait 1
expect message All five Meridian badges
expect item TitaniumIngot 1
expect hidden harbourbox
use Harbour lamp 1
use Harbour lamp 2
use Harbour lamp 3
use Harbour lamp 4
wait 1
expect shown harbourbox
open Harbour master's strongbox
zone seaplane
open Seaplane's crate
zone seacave
open Sea cave chest
zone jump_mt_finale
open Rooftop run prize
